{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_st02",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_st02",
  "title": "策展人會客廳",
  "storyCode": "CR-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bd167abf221e826a172a0581352b7cdeae770d6ba849d7a740a2b69fbb7be45b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（打哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雷內爾可真能折磨人，好好的藝術館開幕式，非要放在大晚上舉辦，還說要一直開到天亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我相信雷內爾一定能給我們看到不一樣的東西，你不也一樣嗎？要不然幹嘛熬這麼晚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了吧。本來想去看街頭藝術社區的藝術狂歡節的，不知道為什麼取消了，我只好來這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界新人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雷內爾的噱頭是真做足了。開幕式的具體安排對我們這樣的高級合作伙伴都要保密……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界新人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，譁眾取寵還是他行啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界前輩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等你搞出的噱頭能讓全泰拉一大半的藝術投資人都願意像跑到克里斯達爾藝術館一樣跑到我們堡壘山城的總部，那時候再在我耳邊抱怨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界新人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的貴族",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "宣傳冊上這個卡西米爾人……他的藝術沙龍真能讓我的畫賣出去嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傲慢的掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡可不是萊塔尼亞，一切全看你講的故事夠不夠打動那些投資人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的貴族",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你不是說全交給你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傲慢的掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早跟你說了，染個頭髮，學點髒話，穿身破衣服，自稱腐朽貴族制度的反叛者，好多人都吃這一套，可你又不幹，那我能替你講什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傲慢的掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最後再給你個溫馨提示，雖然不如叛逆小子，但落魄貴族這套也有人喜歡。至於能不能打動投資人，就看你臨場發揮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請各位保持安靜，我們的開幕式馬上就要開始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "廣播聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "重複一遍，請各位保持安靜，我們的開幕式，馬上就要開始——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷內爾信步走上藝術館前廣場上搭設的演講台。\n他緩緩掃視了幾次台下的人群，尤其是坐在靠近演講台位置的人，確信該來的人全都來了，然後清了清嗓子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位，早安，午安，晚安——請自行對號入座，這取決於你們慣常的入睡時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感謝鼓掌的各位，也感謝沒鼓掌的各位，你們畢竟犧牲了自己寶貴的睡眠時間，陪我一起觀賞雙日城這場偉大的日出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界新人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感謝你們的熱情與期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感謝你們願意與我一起創造歷史，儘管只是一小段，在更久遠的跨度下可能微不足道，但對各位來說，必定銘記終身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傲慢的掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好大的口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天佑玻利瓦爾，天佑多索雷斯♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只知道掏錢的遊客腦袋空空♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像這座城市的未來♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區歌手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老兄，這個字該換了。你幫我伴奏，我幫你創作點更應景的詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區歌手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天佑聯合政府，天佑科瓦爾斯基♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區歌手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "住在垃圾堆的富豪跟軍頭媾合♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區歌手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那怪胎著床的夜晚♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位，歡迎來到多索雷斯，歡迎來到克里斯達爾藝術館。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在進入正題之前，我希望先介紹給各位一個劃時代的企劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我相信，各位並非全都為了藝術館或開幕式而來——“卡西米爾富二代硬湊起來的噱頭罷了”，想必在座各位也有人是這麼想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們大概更關心一個能賺錢的企劃，所以我把它放在前面，滿足你們的好奇心和貪欲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在場的各位，請讓我看到你們隨身帶著的終端，把它高高舉起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來各位不光自認為具有高雅的審美品味，都還趕上了時代的潮流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "便攜終端，多麼偉大的發明，讓人擺脫消磨時光的罪惡感，帶來城市各個角落的消息，把整座城市連結在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我願意為這座未來的富礦添上一座以藝術為名的鑽探平台，讓其中湧出的金幣和紙鈔填滿你們的腰包。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隆重為各位介紹這項突破性的發明，即將在城際網路上掀起浪潮的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虛擬藝術藏品專案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老哥，我怎麼沒見過你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼可能沒見過我？我就住你家樓上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，你是那個……皮斯托？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對對對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你不是去治病了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去治病怎麼了，去治病雷內爾就有權進我們社區搞破壞嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說得好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼樣，等到了藝術館，準不準備大幹一場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然要大幹一場！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就對了！對這種人不能有一點同情心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界新人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虛擬藝術藏品？我們給你投資是要看這種東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，想想看，一部分藝術家以後不再和顏料、畫筆打交道，他們在終端前為城際網路創造的作品同樣能成為你們的投資對象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我把藝術館中收藏的某幅畫作在城際網路上原樣複製，諸位隨時可以在終端上看到畫作的每一個細節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒人可以奪走或複製這幅畫，你擁有處置這幅虛擬畫作的全部權利，想賣，想毀，全由你自己決定——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界新人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——這是對藝術的褻瀆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說我褻瀆藝術？看看你身邊那位大腹便便的投資界前輩，他才是褻瀆藝術的大師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們根本不關注創作者的想法和表達，你們只想把所有解釋的權力握在自己手裡，好方便你們根據行情操縱藝術品價格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傲慢的掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也在做這種事，你父親也在做這種事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我什麼時候說斯特凡·科瓦爾斯基沒有褻瀆藝術了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不用看就知道，你身邊那位看起來唯唯諾諾的人，不就正求著你請人褻瀆他的藝術，好換一筆錢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傲慢的掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……瘋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟觀眾吵架也是他開幕式的一環？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正他是以標新立異聞名的，誰又敢說不是呢？先生，你說呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁，無聊的傢伙，就只知道玩終端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）果然這群傢伙也不是什麼好東西。虛偽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "上尉掩去眼底的凶光，換上了一副漠然的表情，以免在此刻被人看出端倪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "諸位，接下來我要向各位介紹整個泰拉的第一批虛擬藝術藏品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "演講台下的人群暫時靜了下來。\n他們已經領教了雷內爾的不可理喻，但一個不可理喻的人也是人，也想維持自己現有的優越生活，換句話說，也需要錢。\n差別只不過是，遵守規則的正常人會用大家都能接受的方法和和氣氣地賺錢，而不可理喻的人總想在賺錢的同時鄙視其他人。\n但是不要緊，只要他還想要錢，正常人總能找到機會，把那個瘋子的內裡瓜分乾淨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界新人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）恩師，我們這下怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界前輩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）靜觀其變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界前輩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）看看他能給我們做什麼藏品出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界前輩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）城際網路不足以支持一個新的投資領域，但這個瘋子說不定真能挖到什麼寶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界前輩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）反正我們有的是辦法拿到我們想要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些藏品飽含著我這段時間在多索雷斯感受到的善意與誠實，光明與美好，因而具有無與倫比的紀念意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我向各位隆重推出——“煩人上尉”！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界新人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這……這有什麼價值？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傲慢的掮客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這個瘋子，精神錯亂的富家少爺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的貴族",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "完了，全完了，這還能辦起什麼藝術沙龍。我還怎麼賣畫……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……等等，老兄，雷內爾那批虛擬藏品的原型……是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "上尉站起身，先是看了看手裡的終端，然後看了看顯示器，最後和雷內爾視線相接。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "馬特奧上尉，鑑於我們第一次打交道的經歷是如此愉快，我再送你一份禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你將成為泰拉有史以來第一批虛擬藝術藏品的原型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來，在其中挑一個，我願意將其免費贈予你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "全場的視線都集中在上尉身上。\n上尉沒有第一時間回答雷內爾，只是先看了一眼終端。\n終於，他看見了自己一直在等的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用了，雷內爾先生，你留著自己用吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很抱歉，各位，但我有一個緊急消息要在這裡宣布。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的觀眾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是玻利瓦爾聯合政府派駐多索雷斯的代表，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根據我們得到的最新消息，一場針對藝術館的恐怖攻擊即將發生。希望各位能聽從指示有序避難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "據可靠消息，暴徒正往這裡趕來，請各位在我手下士兵的引導下進入藝術館避難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "地平線處，有不少模模糊糊的人影似乎正朝藝術館湧來，人影聚集處甚至還隱約飄來了雜亂的歌聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，大老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "投資界前輩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不！我要找坎黛拉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可不行，喂，你，把他拖走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "軍官的手下",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，雷內爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "馬特奧先生，你真是為我的開幕式增添了一個巨大的驚喜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來人，把他給我拖走，拖到他最喜歡的陽台上去看日出，我等一下再去找他聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，還有，記得讓他自己爬樓梯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大多數人都被我們嚇住——不，都接受我們的安排，正在往克里斯達爾藝術館內部轉移。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有幾個不配合的人不願意聽我們的，您看……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不配合？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等大多數人都進來了，把刀架在他們脖子上，看看他們還配不配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "街頭藝術社區那群人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帶隊的軍官",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有幾分鐘就到。我們安插在其中的人已經成功把他們煽動起來，只等他們到廣場上撒野，把恐怖攻擊的名義坐實了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馬特奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……天就要亮了，我們得趕快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "轉過前面那個彎，我們就到藝術館了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，我等不及要給雷內爾來點震撼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就好！把他的藝術館砸爛，把他那些破玩意搶光！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……我想什麼了？不是說好了要大幹一場嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說的大幹一場是要在藝術館門口搞我們的藝術節，讓雷內爾徹底抬不起頭，你說的大幹一場是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡猾的陌生人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，我先去前面看看狀況！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特克諾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛剛有個傢伙說是住我樓上的，有點可疑——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然後呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區小販",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小販張大了嘴，用手指向一個轉角之隔的藝術館前廣場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "廣場上雖有演講台，有座位，甚至有觀客留在椅子上的外套……\n但是一個人都沒有。\n一個都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
